            "text_d6pYBK": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "t:names.text",
              "settings": {
                "custom_anchor": "",
                "text": "<p>If you can paddle out, find your position in the peak and catch waves on your own — that's where I come in. As your local surf guide, I handle everything: reading the forecast, knowing which break is firing, and getting you there at the right tide.<br/><br/>No crowds. No bad decisions. No wasted mornings at the wrong beach. I know these coastlines inside out and I'll take you to the wave that matches your level and your vibe for that day.<br/><br/>Think of it as having a local friend who happens to know every break in the region — and wakes up early to check the surf for you.</p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "none",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "rte",
                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                "font_size": "1rem",
                "line_height": "normal",
                "letter_spacing": "normal",
                "case": "none",
